{"id":"n89146-4-7","stage":4,"title":"환원 · 还原","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89146-4-7-1","ko":"이렇게 환원 반응이 일어나면 어떤 결과가 나타나요?","zh":"像这样发生还原反应的话，会出现什么结果呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"환원","meaning":"还原","explanation":"환원：还原","readings":[{"term":"환원","audio":"/audio/bec901ee02388d6eb2dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89146","senseId":"4","lemma":"환원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반응이","meaning":"反应","explanation":"반응：反应；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"반응","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15850","senseId":"2","lemma":"반응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어나면","meaning":"发生，起","explanation":"일어나다：发生，起；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"3","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과가","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나타나요?","meaning":"显示，展现","explanation":"나타나다：显示，展现；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"2","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"bec901ee02388d6e","term":"환원","zh":"还原","audio":"/audio/bec901ee02388d6eb2dc.mp3","entryId":"89146","definition":"在化学中，氧脱离与氧结合的物质，或某种物质与氢相结合，或原子、分子及离子等获得电子。","pronunciation":["화눤"]},{"id":"791889c5b68580a4","term":"반응","zh":"反应","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3","entryId":"15850","definition":"两种以上的物质彼此影响，引起化学变化。","pronunciation":["바ː능"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"发生，起","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"事情或事件等产生。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"d6fb8e71960ac802","term":"나타나다","zh":"显示，展现","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3","entryId":"62286","definition":"要发生某事的征兆或某事的结果显露于外。","pronunciation":["나타나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4dd667a767aabd958dd2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89146-4-7-2","ko":"전자를 얻게 돼요.","zh":"会得到电子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전자를","meaning":"电子","explanation":"전자：电子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전자","audio":"/audio/87f51d71894db03dc237.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70835","senseId":"1","lemma":"전자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얻게","meaning":"得到，获取，获得，取得","explanation":"얻다：得到，获取，获得，取得；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"얻다","audio":"/audio/e9a48e141ad07674b586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73863","senseId":"6","lemma":"얻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sou